[Donut.Launcher.exe] ..> [Start-Donut.ps1] : hosts / launches
[Start-Donut.ps1] ..> [DonutApp.ps1] : dot-sources
[DonutApp.ps1] ..> [MainPresenter] : initializes
[MainPresenter] ..> [MainWindow.xaml] : manages
[MainPresenter] ..> [HomePresenter] : creates
[MainPresenter] ..> [SettingsPresenter] : settings overlay (lazy)
[MainPresenter] ..> [AdResetPasswordWorker.ps1] : temp-password reset (pool)
[MainPresenter] ..> [TrayPresenter] : tray icon + show/hide
[MainPresenter] ..> [TourPresenter] : first-run guided tour
[MainPresenter] ..> [Donut.Interop\n(HotkeyManager)] : global hotkey
[MainPresenter] ..> [Apply-StartupTask.ps1] : start-with-Windows apply
[MainPresenter] ..> [PendingIntentStore] : gated click across elevation restart
[MainPresenter] ..> [ElevationRelaunch] : UAC relaunch spec + spawn
[MainPresenter] ..> [DispatcherWatchdog] : UI-stall diagnostics
[Apply-StartupTask.ps1] ..> [StartupTaskService] : reconcile + register

[HomePresenter] ..> [HomeViewModel] : builds + wires commands
[HomeViewModel] ..> [HomeView.xaml] : DataContext (bindings)
[HomeViewModel] ..> [HostViewModel] : Machines collection
[MainPresenter] ..> [MainViewModel] : builds + wires commands
[MainViewModel] ..> [MainWindow.xaml] : DataContext (bindings)
[ToastService] ..> [ToastViewModel] : enqueues
[DialogPresenter] ..> [DialogViewModel] : per-dialog content
[DialogPresenter] ..> [DialogWindow.xaml] : shows modal
[SettingsPresenter] ..> [KeybindRecorder] : records shortcut fields
[LoginPresenter] ..> [LoginViewModel] : device-flow output
[LoginViewModel] ..> [LoginWindow.xaml] : DataContext (bindings)
[Donut.Mvvm\n(ObservableObject + RelayCommand)] ..> [HostViewModel] : base types (all VMs)
[HomePresenter] ..> [RemoteUpdateService] : scan + updates
[HomePresenter] ..> [InventoryPresenter] : detail panel
[HomePresenter] ..> [ResolutionCoordinator] : resolve + warm
[HomePresenter] ..> [FinderPresenter] : AD finder + user Lens
[InventoryPresenter] ..> [InventoryService] : per-machine probe
[InventoryPresenter] ..> [DiskUsageService] : storage scan
[ResolutionCoordinator] ..> [HostResolver] : resolve + prefetch IP
[ResolutionCoordinator] ..> [ResolveWorker.ps1] : fast IP resolve (direct child, no pool)
[FinderPresenter] ..> [ActiveDirectoryService] : forests + prefix config
[FinderPresenter] ..> [PersonLensViewModel] : user Lens (agent lookup)
[FinderPresenter] ..> [AdSearchWorker.ps1] : AD search (pool, one job per forest)
[AdSearchWorker.ps1] ..> [ActiveDirectoryService] : in-process forest search (LDAP)
[FinderPresenter] ..> [LensLookupWorker.ps1] : Lens lookups + -OwnerOf owner batch (pool)
[LensLookupWorker.ps1] ..> [PersonLensService] : warm / lookup on the pool
[PersonLensService] ..> [LensAgent.ps1] : supervises (task) + request/response exchange
[HomePresenter] ..> [AsyncJob] : queues
[HomePresenter] ..> [RecentConnectionsStore] : persists
[HomePresenter] ..> [ScanCacheDecision] : 24h reuse

[RemoteUpdateService] ..> [ExecutionService]
[InventoryService] ..> [ExecutionService]
[DiskUsageService] ..> [ExecutionService]
[RemoteUpdateService] ..> [DriverMatchingService]

[RemoteWorker.ps1] ..> [ExecutionService] : dispatches job phases (PsExec to target)
[ActiveDirectoryService] ..> [AdUnlockWorker.ps1] : unlock account
[ActiveDirectoryService] ..> [AdResetPasswordWorker.ps1] : reset password
[AsyncJob] ..> [RunspaceManager] : uses pool
[AsyncJob] ..> [WorkerProcess] : spawns child pwsh (isolation)
[WorkerProcess] ..> [RemoteWorker.ps1] : runs as a separate process

[SettingsPresenter] ..> [ConfigManager]
[ConfigManager] ..> [AppConfig]
[ConfigManager] ..> [config/]

[UpdatePresenter] ..> [SelfUpdateService]
[LoginPresenter] ..> [SelfUpdateService]
[SelfUpdateService] ..> [InstallWorker.ps1] : invokes
@enduml
